  "content_hash": "80586bf5ebf3b59d614200f2e5f8487690b437be813259351307fc40cc394430",
  "dependencies": [],
  "description": "Migrating Classic email templates (Text, HTML with Letterhead, Custom HTML, Visualforce email) to Lightning Email Templates (LET) and the Email Template Builder. Covers merge-field translation, Letterhead-to-Enhanced-Letterhead conversion, Visualforce email retention strategy, folder reorganization, sender-context (OrgWideEmailAddress) preservation, and downstream Email Alert / Process Builder / Flow rewiring. NOT for transactional Apex email sending (use apex/apex-outbound-email-patterns) or marketing email broadcasts (use Marketing Cloud / Account Engagement).",
  "file_location": "skills/admin/classic-email-template-migration",
  "id": "admin/classic-email-template-migration",
  "inputs": [
    "Inventory of Classic templates by type (Text, HTML w/ Letterhead, Custom HTML, Visualforce)",
    "Folder structure and sharing permissions on the Classic templates",
    "Downstream consumers: Email Alerts, Process Builder, Flow, Apex `setTemplateId()`, Marketing campaigns",
    "Brand assets: existing Letterhead images, logo URLs, color palette",
    "Whether the org uses OrgWideEmailAddress senders that must be preserved"
  ],
  "name": "classic-email-template-migration",
  "official_sources": [
    "`type` values text/html/custom/visualforce and the letterhead split \u2014 api_meta 264 L59137-59145",
    "`UiType` Aloha/SFX/SFX_Sample and \"If UiType is SFX, the type must be custom\" \u2014 api_meta 264 L59147-59152",
    "Email Alert `template` is a named reference; sender from `senderType`/`senderAddress` \u2014 api_meta 264 L143859-143892",
    "`ApprovalProcess.emailTemplate` takes a Classic template \u2014 api_meta 264 L25167-25170",
    "Classic letterhead = `BrandTemplate`; `EnhancedLetterhead` fields \u2014 object_reference 264 L51116, L110800-110863",
    "Folder `Type` Email vs EmailTemplate; `EmailTemplateFolder` and `sharedTo` \u2014 object_reference 264 L146139-146140; api_meta 264 L77398-77399, L77441",
    "EmailTemplate sObject Reference \u2014 https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.object_reference.meta/object_reference/sforce_api_objects_emailtemplate.htm",
